  "scientific_review": [
    "All32 predeclared original section/date cases are retained:North Cape20,22,24,26E/70.5-73.5N longitude cuts and Makassar1,2,3,4S/117.5-120E latitude cuts on four quarterly2022dates. Native components,signed90/180degree values,coordinates,indices,hyperslabs,timestamps,metadata,nulls,scores/local peaks and selected5/10/20cm/s layers remain exact cloud output. No unsuccessful,edge or primary-censored result is omitted.",
    "Fifty-eight cloud checks passed in12/10/5/5/8/8/10groups. Frozen connected layers,interval selection,both bounded readers and both native geometries are unchanged. Ten new tests cover declared32targets/current windows,aggregate preflight budget beyond individual-axis fits,exact frozen read/audit identities,both source geometries with opposing surfaces,one shared interleaved retry ledger,future-attempt reserve on the second axis,and nontransport/shape/exhaustion behavior. Every actual retained section independently re-audits its own axis/components/interval diagnosis.",
    "Mixed preflight delegates frozen geometry then checks the full joint count before any fields. One shared BoundedMixedReads reservation aliases both frozen read methods;all axes share counters,retry reserve and durable receipt. Max3exact failed-component/hyperslab attempts with2/5seconds,full future first-attempt reserve and no successful replay remain. Ledger records requested/decoded quantities,not wire traffic or physical precision;all original pair/byte/publication caps stay fixed.",
    "North Cape BSO/southwestern Barents context uses50-350m eastward90degree positive signed integral and core>10cm/s. Fresh Baumann2026 primary text defines a salinity-ranked mean core,not a pronounced mean velocity jet;350m core scale and50m upper exclusion are analysis domains,not boundaries.1993-2022 mean sections and uneven seasonal sampling do not validate2022 axes or annual extrema. No Atlantic-Water class or extension to75-77N Hopen Northern-branch route is inferred.",
    "Makassar partial ITF branch uses50-200m southward180degree positive integral and core>10cm/s. Fresh Jiang2019 primary text and retained Figure5 caption distinguish observed100m mean core from model profiles,and2004-2012 comparison mean from broader2004-2017 observing span. Core location is not current bottom,thickness or annual range. Surface reversals/freshwater caps,narrow channel and native masks matter. No eastern inflow or Lombok/Ombai/Timor exit coverage,full system route or inherited200m model core is admitted.",
    "Neither current has a positive surface gate,relative surface comparison or thermal/salinity gate. Greatest eligible interval integral wins;first southern index on longitude cuts and western index on latitude cuts break ties. Gate/support-edge winners remain unresolved without weaker interior replacement or post-result tuning. Sensitivities have their own qualifying seed at the same selected column. Fixed geographic frames are not rotated along curved current axes.",
    "All stops/gates/windows/cutoffs are editorial diagnostics,not measured current axes,widths,errors or whole-system endpoints. Geographic maxima may be neighboring/mesoscale flow. Coastal/topographic masks and channels resolved by few native cells can censor/confound selection. Independent regional connectors cannot replace/extrapolate canonical routes or inherit branch depth numbers.",
    "Full native0-5000m adjacent finite brackets preserve upper/lower contours,statuses,last supported bounds and paired spans. Never bridge sign/cutoff/missing gaps or use selection endpoints,historical core scales,instrument limits,sills,bed or domain stops as current bottoms. Same-sign deep flow can connect;model span is not physical thickness. No thermal/density/salinity classification or pressure conversion occurs.",
    "All acquisition,numerics,geometry,audits and tests run sequentially in cloud on one idle CPU. Local work is code,primary text/metadata,hashes and exact retention only;no local field calculations/tests or runtime/UI work. Frozen artifacts,canonical registerv48,inventoryv25 and eddy102size-referenced/34unresolved baseline remain preserved by source retention.",
    "Quarterly instantaneous probes are not seasonal means,annual envelopes,independent observations,confidence limits,complete physical depths/thicknesses,matched areas,volumes,state joins or global sums. Later projections must retain all original nodes,gaps,axis metadata and per-current windows. Remaining coverage and runtime/query integration stay unfinished."
  ],
